where how why which whose that this these those there here all each every any
some no not only very more most such much many few other new old first last
his her its their our your my be been being have has had is are was were am do
does did can could may might must shall should will would want need use said
says made used called named known born based located including following let
'''.split())
INSTITUTIONS = set('''
city town village county state country university school college institute academy
company corporation association committee council district department government
ministry court hospital church party group club team center centre union industry
society organization agency office bank fund system project program
'''.split())
TITLES = set('mr mrs ms miss dr prof sir lord lady saint st'.split())
SURNAMES = ('son', 'sen', 'man', 'mann', 'berg', 'stein', 'ski', 'sky',
            'ov', 'ova', 'vich', 'ovich', 'ez', 'wood', 'worth')
IRREGULAR = set('''
wrote told said went began became took gave made got found saw came ran won lost
left kept knew thought felt brought bought sold held stood sat heard spoke spent
read put met grew drew ate drank drove fell flew forgot broke built chose caught
sent paid taught wore understood led
'''.split())
VERBS = set('''
says tells asks writes reads explains describes introduces reports announces
notes states argues claims believes thinks knows wants needs likes loves hopes
tries starts begins ends continues works plays lives returns leaves comes goes
gets takes gives makes puts keeps finds sees looks feels seems becomes brings
runs moves leads helps serves offers provides uses includes means shows adds
suggests calls talks teaches wins receives attends
'''.split())
AUXILIARIES = {
    'is': (.065, .680), 'was': (.228, 1.143),
    'has': (.148, .958), 'had': (.182, 1.027),
    'are': (-.045, .146), 'were': (.010, .343),
    'have': (-.034, .282), 'been': (.043, .365),
