'Both' has by far the strongest negative response. Capitalization,
spacing and the preceding grammatical word modulate it. The smaller
responses distinguish 'not only' from 'the only', and recognize 'each',
'either', 'neither' and a few translations. Matches are whole token strings,
not word-sense judgments; all other activity is omitted.
An 80-character carry joins split words and resets at document boundaries.
