"""A mostly token-local detector of requests and obtaining things.

'REQUEST' and its ordinary spellings give strong negative activations, as do
Chinese words for requesting or applying. API request identifiers, polite
appeals, queries, demand, downloads and purchases give weaker responses.
A one-token memory handles split word endings and 'request of/to/for ...'.
Other vocabulary is treated as inactive; this omits many small lexical effects.
