"""A lexical implication/suggestion detector, not a logical validity checker.

Double implication arrows and forms of 'suggest' and 'imply' fire strongly.
Assignment, thinner arrows, and indication/recommendation/meaning words fire
more weakly. Symbol gains depend on whitespace, a closing quote or an operand
on the left, and the start of a document. The only memory is the previous
token, also used to recognize e.g. and i.e.; it resets between documents.
The implication stem impl also fires in code; its following ies receives a
strong response when the two tokens spell implies. Other unlisted tokens
are predicted as zero.
