words and symbols of a few families:
  - implication arrows (=>, ⇒, ==>, ⟹): strongest (~4.2)
  - the 'suggest' family (suggest, suggests, suggested, suggesting, suggestion): ~3.6
  - the 'imply' family, incl. the word pieces 'impl' + 'ies'/'ied' (implies, implied): ~1.8
  - words of signalling or recommending (indicate, recommend, propose, reveal, hint,
    clue, means, leading): ~0.7
  - assignment, equality and arrow operators (=, :=, ->, ::, )=, ===, &&, and the
    'e.g.' / 'i.e.' pieces): ~0.55
