The main positive rule is a letter following a marked long vowel,
especially long i in Thai and Indic scripts. Longer tokens dilute it.
Long-i signs themselves receive a small positive response.
AI/AU vowel signs and Hebrew pointing receive negative values.
Smaller, fixed word-class responses cover utility, competence, necessity,
